<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>潮位站一覽表 {{ roc_year }} 年</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@600;700&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* ── 色彩變數（與 report3 一致）──────────────────────────────── */
  :root {
    --ink:      #1D3557;
    --steel:    #457B9D;
    --stripe:   #F1F3F5;
    --text:     #212529;
    --hairline: #C9D2D8;
    --paper:    #FFFFFF;
  }

  /* ── 基礎 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #DDE3E7;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; }
    .page { box-shadow: none !important; }
  }

  /* ── A4 直式頁面 ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @page {
    size: A4 portrait;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 210mm;
    min-height: 297mm;
    margin: 14px auto;
    background: var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    padding: 14mm 14mm 10mm;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* ── 頁首 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 6mm;
  }
  .page-title .zh {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    display: block;
  }
  .page-title .en {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--steel);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ── 表格 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }

  /* 欄寬（合計 100%）：
     序號4.5 站名11 舊碼8 新碼8 位置11 緯度8 經度9 高程8 水準點6.5 量測年6.5 所屬機構12 儀器7.5
     位置欄每行字數上限 = station_list.py 的 _LOC_MAX_CHARS，改此欄寬時要同步調整。 */
  col.c-seq     { width:  4.5%; }
  col.c-name    { width: 11%; }
  col.c-old     { width:  8%; }
  col.c-new     { width:  8%; }
  col.c-loc     { width: 11%; }
  col.c-lat     { width:  8%; }
  col.c-lon     { width:  9%; }
  col.c-elev    { width:  8%; }
  col.c-tgbm    { width:  6.5%; }
  col.c-year    { width:  6.5%; }
  col.c-sponsor { width: 12%; }
  col.c-type    { width:  7.5%; }

  thead th {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 8.5px;
    padding: 4px 2px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  /* 雙列表頭：第一列為大欄標題，第二列為子標題 */
  thead th.group-header {
    font-size: 8.5px;
  }

  tbody td {
    padding: 3.5px 3px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    font-size: 8.5px;
    text-align: center;
    vertical-align: middle;
    line-height: 1.5;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--stripe); }
  td.name-cell {
    text-align: left;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }
  td.name-cell .zh { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); display: block; }
  td.name-cell .en { color: #555; font-size: 7.5px; display: block; }
  td.seq-cell {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    color: var(--steel);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  td.mono {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 7.5px;
  }
  td.not-announced {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 7.5px;
  }

  /* 跨頁時不在行中間切斷 */
  tbody tr { break-inside: avoid; }

  /* ── 腳注 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .footnote {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 3mm;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: #6c757d;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── 頁尾 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  footer.report-footer {
    padding-top: 3mm;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: #6c757d;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- 頁面標題 -->
  <div class="page-title">
    <span class="zh">潮位站一覽表</span>
    <span class="en">Table of Tide Stations</span>
  </div>

  <!-- 測站資料表 -->
  <table>
    <colgroup>
      <col class="c-seq">
      <col class="c-name">
      <col class="c-old">
      <col class="c-new">
      <col class="c-loc">
      <col class="c-lat">
      <col class="c-lon">
      <col class="c-elev">
      <col class="c-tgbm">
      <col class="c-year">
      <col class="c-sponsor">
      <col class="c-type">
    </colgroup>
    <thead>
      <!-- 第一列：大欄標題（跨欄） -->
      <tr>
        <th rowspan="2">序號</th>
        <th rowspan="2">站名<br>Station</th>
        <th rowspan="2">舊站碼<br>Old<br>Station Id</th>
        <th rowspan="2">新站碼<br>New<br>Station Id</th>
        <th rowspan="2">位置<br>Location</th>
        <th colspan="2" class="group-header">經緯度<br>Lat. &amp; Long.</th>
        <th colspan="3" class="group-header">潮位站水準點<br>Tide gauge benchmark</th>
        <th rowspan="2">所屬機構<br>Sponsor</th>
        <th rowspan="2">儀器型式<br>Instrument<br>Type</th>
      </tr>
      <!-- 第二列：子欄標題 -->
      <tr>
        <th>緯度<br>Lat.</th>
        <th>經度<br>Long.</th>
        <th>高程值<br>(公尺)<br>Elevation<br>(m)</th>
        <th>水準點<br>名稱<br>No.</th>
        <th>量測年分<br>Survey<br>Year</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for s in stations %}
      <tr>
        <td class="seq-cell">{{ s.seq }}.</td>
        <td class="name-cell">
          <span class="zh">{{ s.name_zh }}</span>
          <span class="en">{{ s.name_en }}</span>
        </td>
        <td class="mono">{{ s.stid }}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{ s.stid_new }}</td>
        <td style="text-align:left; font-size:7.5px; padding-left:3px;">{% for ln in s.location_lines %}{{ ln }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
        <td class="mono" style="font-size:7px;">{{ s.lat }}</td>
        <td class="mono" style="font-size:7px;">{{ s.lon }}</td>
        <td {% if s.elevation == '尚未公告' %}class="not-announced"{% else %}class="mono"{% endif %}>
          {{ s.elevation }}
        </td>
        <td {% if s.tgbm == '尚未公告' %}class="not-announced"{% else %}class="mono"{% endif %}>
          {{ s.tgbm }}
        </td>
        <td {% if s.report_year == '—' %}class="not-announced"{% else %}class="mono"{% endif %}>
          {{ s.report_year }}
        </td>
        <td style="font-size:7.5px;">{{ s.sponsor_zh }}<br><span style="color:#6c757d;">{{ s.sponsor_en }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ s.type_zh }}<br><span style="color:#6c757d; font-size:7.5px;">{{ s.type_en }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- 腳注 -->
  <div class="footnote">
    1. 高程值以臺灣高程基準 TWVD2001（以基隆港平均海水面為零點）為基準。<br>
       &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Elevations are referenced to Taiwan Vertical Datum 2001 (TWVD2001),
       in which the mean sea level of Keelung Port is the zero datum level.<br>
    {% if has_lmsl %}
    2. 標記 * 之測站位於離島，高程以當地平均海水面（LMSL）為基準，非 TWVD2001。<br>
       &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Stations marked with * are located on outlying islands and referenced to Local Mean Sea Level (LMSL).<br>
    {% endif %}
    3. 「尚未公告」表示內政部國土測繪中心尚未公告該站水準點高程。<br>
       &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Not announced" indicates that the elevation has not yet been officially released by the Ministry of Interior.<br>
    4. 「量測年分」為該水準點高程值所依據之內政部量測成果年分；本表沿用該次量測之高程值，不隨內政部每年公告值逐年更新。<br>
       &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Survey Year" is the year of the Ministry of the Interior survey on which the benchmark elevation is based.
       The elevation is retained from that survey and is not updated with the Ministry's annual announcements.
  </div>

  <footer class="report-footer">
    <div></div>
    <div>Tidal Observation Data Annual Report {{ year }}</div>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
